      "t": "Back at the agency, agent Gabriel and actress Sofia wait anxiously beside the phone for singer Julien Dore to call back. While Gabriel fidgets with impatience, Sofia tries to stay composed and avoid sounding overly eager. Listen to the scene in French first.",
